    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Battle Medic.</strong> If you have a Healer’s Kit, you can expend one of its uses to tend to a creature within 5 feet of yourself as a Utilize action. That creature can spend one of its Hit Point Dice; you roll that die, and the creature regains Hit Points equal to the roll plus your Proficiency Bonus.</p><p><strong>Healing Rerolls.</strong> Whenever you roll a die to determine how many Hit Points you restore with a spell or with this feat’s Battle Medic benefit, you can reroll the die if it rolls a 1, and you must use the new roll.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-xrN1GYo3yPWlhCbl\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use the <em>Battle Medic</em> of the creature’s Hit Point Die size (a 1 is rerolled): the creature spends that die on its sheet, and you remove a use from your Healer’s Kit. Reroll the 1s of your healing spells yourself.</p></section>",
